  "system": {
    "identifier": "breath-of-earth-justice",
    "description": "<p>You begin to collect earth release chakra until it laces the striking portion of your weapon, magnifying its weight.</p>\n<p>Make 2 melee taijutsu attacks as you strike with a flurry of weapon attacks followed by manifestations of earth release chakra of your design. On a hit, you deal your [Weapons damage] + 2d8 earth damage.</p>\n<p>An affected creature must make a Strength saving throw as you disable them on a failed save. A disabled creature cannot wield weapons or use hand seals (HS) for the next minute. A disabled creature remakes their saving throw at the end of each of their turns, ending the disabled effect on them on a success.</p>\n<p>Chain 2: If both attacks were successful against the same creature, they make their saving throw at disadvantage.</p>\n<p>At Higher Ranks: For each rank you cast this jutsu above B-Rank increase the cost of this jutsu by 3 and the damage by 1d8.</p>",
